  span:    POST /api/executions [HTTP SERVER]

[2026-05-18T23:47:00.010Z] InstrumentedQueue.add() — injectOtelContext()
  traceId:      4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736  ← same
  spanId:       a3ce929d0e0e4736  (enqueue span)
  parentSpanId: 00f067aa0ba902b7  ← child of HTTP span
  span:         octo:execution publish [PRODUCER]
