  parentSpanId: a3ce929d0e0e4736  ← child of enqueue span
  span:         octo:execution process [CONSUMER]
  octo.correlation.id: corr-01JXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

[2026-05-18T23:47:30.000Z] Lease expires — reclaimer fires casReclaim()
  traceId:      4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736  ← same
